(7674408, 1253730, 34171, '<td valign="top">Hey, I''ve seen that drain thing before... but I like it :]</td>', 'Hey, I''ve seen that drain thing before... but I like it :]', '2020-09-11 13:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674624, 1254136, 114285, '<td valign="top">Stunning image, and the editing is perfect. Should do well.</td>', 'Stunning image, and the editing is perfect. Should do well.', '2020-09-16 00:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674625, 1254120, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely, pretty sure I know whose this is.</td>', 'Lovely, pretty sure I know whose this is.', '2020-09-16 00:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674699, 1253965, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the stark contrast in colors. The black background accents the colors. The only negative is that the foremost blue and orange flowers are slightly out of focus and they are primary in the composition.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the stark contrast in colors. The black background accents the colors. The only negative is that the foremost blue and orange flowers are slightly out of focus and they are primary in the composition.', '2020-09-17 08:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674700, 1254120, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition. The white background adds to the composition by defining the subjects. The arrangement of the flowers adds balance and appeal to the effect. One of my favorites.</td>', 'I really like your composition. The white background adds to the composition by defining the subjects. The arrangement of the flowers adds balance and appeal to the effect. One of my favorites.', '2020-09-17 08:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674701, 1254128, 3306, '<td valign="top">Gotta love the expression!</td>', 'Gotta love the expression!', '2020-09-17 08:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674702, 1254138, 3306, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. The colors really pop!</td>', 'Simple and effective. The colors really pop!', '2020-09-17 08:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674703, 1254064, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the idea ( I love pictures of ladybugs (Asian beetles)). I would have suggested cropping a little tighter, trying to brighten the green in the background, and more DOF on the plant that the beetle is on. I realize that oftentimes these shots are controlled by nature!</td>', 'I like the idea ( I love pictures of ladybugs (Asian beetles)). I would have suggested cropping a little tighter, trying to brighten the green in the background, and more DOF on the plant that the beetle is on. I realize that oftentimes these shots are controlled by nature!', '2020-09-17 08:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674704, 1254065, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and well balanced.</td>', 'Nice setup and well balanced.', '2020-09-17 08:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674705, 1253843, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully arranged and enticing.</td>', 'Wonderfully arranged and enticing.', '2020-09-17 08:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674706, 1253847, 3306, '<td valign="top">Its a good idea. It satisfies the challenge. I think it would have been a better composition if you could have used a more realistic background. Maybe a large wooden bowl with a patterned tablecloth and some utensils to indicate what the vegetables are going to be used for.</td>', 'Its a good idea. It satisfies the challenge. I think it would have been a better composition if you could have used a more realistic background. Maybe a large wooden bowl with a patterned tablecloth and some utensils to indicate what the vegetables are going to be used for.', '2020-09-17 08:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674707, 1254136, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a very attractive composition. I really like the processing and lighting.</td>', 'This is a very attractive composition. I really like the processing and lighting.', '2020-09-17 08:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
